.public-cases-ehl

# The shared folder drop. The five docs below are tracked on purpose -- the handbook
# is the API contract. EVERYTHING else in there stays out: 375 MB of encrypted cases,
# and Discord says checked-in claim data is a ranking penalty. Deny-by-default, so a
# new file the organisers add tomorrow is ignored until someone opts it in.
public-cases-ehl/*
!public-cases-ehl/API_HANDBOOK.md
!public-cases-ehl/GAME_DESCRIPTION.md
!public-cases-ehl/pixi.toml
!public-cases-ehl/pixi.lock
!public-cases-ehl/starter_script.py

# A stray archive anywhere is a case archive until proven otherwise.
*.7z
*.zip

# macOS
*.DS_Store
.DS_Store
